SUMMARY:Little Jamaica & Oakwood Vaughan Planning Framework
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260602T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260602T193000
UID:1061@haveyoursay.toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Project: Planning Study Community Consultation Meetings\n\nDev
 elopment Review staff are leading the Little Jamaica and Oakwood Vaughan P
 lanning Framework Study. The Little Jamaica and Oakwood Vaughan Planning F
 ramework Proposals Report\, together with a draft Planning Framework for t
 he area\, was adopted by Planning and Housing Committee on April 14\, 2026
  (PH29.2). The draft Little Jamaica and Oakwood Vaughan Planning Framework
  draws from extensive community input and brings together community priori
 ties to guide future growth and development. Join us at this virtual consu
 ltation meeting to learn more about the planning framework\, ask questions
 \, and share your comments.\n\nRegistration: https://events.teams.microsof
 t.com/event/a3716766-ba13-4bf3-811a-87732ef64bbe@f0bc8ec6-9ed8-4d0c-9189-4
 11ad949cc65
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://haveyoursay.toronto.ca/development-review-city-planning-planni
 ng-study-events/little-jamaica-and-oakwood-vaughan-planning-framework
X-SOURCE:City Planning Consultations
END:VEVENT
